        <div class="faq-container">
            <div class="faq-item">
                <div class="faq-question">
                    Are your reviews safe for my app/business?
                    <i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-answer">
                    Yes, absolutely. We use 100% real user profiles with natural delivery patterns (drip-feed). Our methods strictly adhere to Google and Play Store guidelines, ensuring there is zero risk of policy violation or account bans.
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-item">
                <div class="faq-question">
                    Will the reviews ever drop or disappear?
                    <i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-answer">
                    Our reviews are highly permanent and sticky. However, algorithm updates can occasionally affect even genuine reviews. That's why we provide a 90-day Free Refill Guarantee—if any review drops within this period, we replace it at no extra cost.
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-item">
                <div class="faq-question">
                    How long does it take to complete an order?
                    <i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-answer">
                    Delivery time depends on the project size. To maintain safety and look natural, we deliver reviews gradually (usually 2-5 reviews per day depending on the current metrics of your app/map). We'll give you a clear timeline before starting.
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-item">
                <div class="faq-question">
